{"id": "R011", "category": "resolvable", "persona": "Nils, 60, brief", "language": "sv", "expected_outcome": "resolved", "expected_escalation_reason": null, "notes": "", "target_turns": 9, "turns_taken": 11, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "IVT Geo 412C", "serial": null, "problem": "Säkringen har löst ut, displayen är helt svart. — Displayen är svart, jag vet inte om det finns någon kod. Säkringen löste ut.", "category": "unknown", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Nils Karlsson", "email": "", "phone": "+46701234567", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 52 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 26, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": null, "session_severity": "urgent", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "IVT Geo 412C", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 9, "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "payload_json": {"summary": "IVT Geo 412C värmepump har helt svart display och säkringen har löst ut, vilket indikerar strömlöshet. Symptomen tyder på ett elfel, potentiellt allvarligt, och kräver professionell felsökning. Kunden har kontrollerat säkringen som löste ut, men displayen förblev svart. Nästa steg är att boka ett servicebesök. Kontaktuppgifter (namn, telefonnummer, adress) och samtycke har inhämtats.", "customer": {"name": "Nils Karlsson", "email": "lars.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 52"}, "severity": "urgent", "equipment": {"model": "IVT Geo 412C", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Identified no power symptom (tripped breaker, black display)", "Recommended initial safe check: reset main breaker for the unit"]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hej! Jag är Nordland VVS assistent. Jag kan hjälpa till med värmepumpar, vattenpumpar/brunnar och vattenfilter. Låt oss ta reda på vad som händer. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Säkringen har löst ut, displayen är helt svart på värmepumpen."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Förlåt, jag uppfattade inte riktigt. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Värmepump"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Okej. Beskriv kort vad problemet är.", "chips": [], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Säkringen har löst ut, displayen är helt svart."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket märke är det?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "Debe", "label": "Debe"}, {"value": "Grundfos", "label": "Grundfos"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Annat / inte listat"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilken modell är det? Ett foto av typskylten är perfekt om du har ett.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "Jag vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT Geo 412C"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "När säkringen har löst ut och displayen är helt svart på din IVT Geo 412C, betyder det att värmepumpen inte får ström. Det första steget är att kontrollera huvudsäkringen för värmepumpen i din elcentral och återställa den om den har löst ut. Om säkringen löser ut igen direkt eller om displayen fortfarande är svart efter att du återställt säkringen, behöver en Nordland-tekniker titta på det. Det kan vara ett internt elfel som kräver professionell felsökning.\n\nInnan jag skickar detta vidare till en tekniker från Nordland VVS — beskriv gärna problemet lite mer i detalj, och om maskinen visar någon fel- eller larmkod, skicka en bild på displayen (det hjälper teknikern mycket). Finns ingen kod, säg bara till.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Displayen är svart, jag vet inte om det finns någon kod. Säkringen löste ut."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag vill gärna att en tekniker från Nordland VVS hjälper dig med detta. Får jag ta några uppgifter så de kan höra av sig — vad heter du?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Nils Karlsson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket telefonnummer når vi dig bäst på?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Och din e-post? (skriv 'skip' om du hellre avstår.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "skip"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Slutligen, vilket postnummer eller adress har du så vi kan skicka en tekniker?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag har allt jag behöver. Ska jag skicka detta till Nordland VVS så att en tekniker kan höra av sig?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Inte än"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Välkommen tillbaka — kul att höra från dig igen; jag ser att vi har hjälpt dig tidigare. Tack Nils Karlsson! Jag har skickat dina uppgifter till Nordland VVS — de hör av sig på +46701234567 så snart de kan. Något mer jag kan hjälpa till med?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.4857783317565918, 0.6377487182617188, 0.014862060546875, 0.0632638931274414, 5.948498964309692, 0.01869511604309082, 0.015822887420654297, 0.07149124145507812, 0.01857757568359375, 0.021086454391479492, 1.5276126861572266], "avg_latency_sec": 0.893039811741222, "wallclock_sec": 170.33759212493896, "error": null}
{"id": "R016", "category": "resolvable", "persona": "Sara, 29, quick texter", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "resolved", "expected_escalation_reason": null, "notes": "", "target_turns": 9, "turns_taken": 9, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "decision", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "402", "serial": null, "problem": "noisy again — no error codes. it's like a rattling sound.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Sara Johansson", "email": "sara.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 52 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 31, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "402", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 10, "escalation_reason": "decision", "payload_json": {"summary": "", "customer": {"name": "Sara Johansson", "email": "sara.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 52"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "402", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Customer confirmed extract-air filter checked/cleaned, noise persists", "Identified dirty fan wheel as next likely cause for noise per manual"]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "vent 402 noisy again, cleaned it last month, filter maybe?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thank you for confirming it's an IVT 402. You mentioned it's noisy again and you cleaned it last month. The manual for the IVT 402 (page 14) states that noise can be caused by a dirty extract-air filter. Even if you cleaned it last month, it's worth checking again, as filter conditions can vary. Please check the extract-air filter and clean it if necessary. This is a routine maintenance step you can perform.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Checked it already, still noisy."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thank you for checking the filter again. Since the noise persists after cleaning the extract-air filter, the next step, according to the IVT 402 manual (Troubleshooting, p.14), is to check if the fan wheel is dirty. A dirty fan wheel can cause noise. This is a task that requires a technician to safely access and clean. I'll arrange for a Nordland technician to inspect and clean the fan wheel for you.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "no error codes. it's like a rattling sound."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Sara Johansson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "sara.johansson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Sara Johansson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701234567 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.1698415279388428, 5.3454430103302, 4.928961992263794, 0.05887317657470703, 0.04210519790649414, 0.06940364837646484, 0.05837821960449219, 0.050429582595825195, 0.860192060470581], "avg_latency_sec": 1.3981809351179335, "wallclock_sec": 57.976884603500366, "error": null}
