 indicate 'IVT 490 exhaust_air').", "Requested customer to confirm the exact model number to ensure correct manual usage."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hej! Jag är Nordland VVS assistent. Jag kan hjälpa till med värmepumpar, vattenpumpar/brunnar och vattenfilter. Låt oss ta reda på vad som händer. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Min varmvattenberedare kopplad till värmepumpen ger ljummet vatten, ECO-läge är på tror jag."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Förlåt, jag uppfattade inte riktigt. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Värmepump"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Okej. Beskriv kort vad problemet är.", "chips": [{"value": "no_heat", "label": "Ingen värme"}, {"value": "error_code", "label": "Felkod på displayen"}, {"value": "noise", "label": "Konstigt ljud"}, {"value": "leaking", "label": "Läcker"}, {"value": "high_bills", "label": "Högre räkningar"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ingen värme"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket märke är det?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Annat / inte listat"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilken modell är det? Ett foto av typskylten är perfekt om du har ett.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "Jag vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Jag vet inte exakt, men det är en IVT luft-vattenpump."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Hej! För att kunna hjälpa dig på bästa sätt behöver jag bekräfta vilken modell av IVT värmepump du har. Du nämnde tidigare att det var en IVT luft-vattenpump, men våra interna anteckningar tyder på att det kan vara en IVT 490 frånluftsvärmepump. Kan du vänligen dubbelkolla modellbeteckningen på din värmepump? Ofta finns den på en typskylt på maskinen. Det är viktigt att vi har rätt modell för att jag ska kunna ge dig korrekt och säker vägledning.\n\nInnan jag skickar detta vidare till en tekniker från Nordland VVS — beskriv gärna problemet lite mer i detalj, och om maskinen visar någon fel- eller larmkod, skicka en bild på displayen (det hjälper teknikern mycket). Finns ingen kod, säg bara till.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Det är en IVT Geo 412C. Det är varmvattenberedaren som är kopplad till den som ger ljummet vatten. ECO-läget verkar vara på."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag vill gärna att en tekniker från Nordland VVS hjälper dig med detta. Får jag ta några uppgifter så de kan höra av sig — vad heter du?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Henrik Andersson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket telefonnummer når vi dig bäst på?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Och din e-post? (skriv 'skip' om du hellre avstår.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "henrik.andersson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Slutligen, vilket postnummer eller adress har du så vi kan skicka en tekniker?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag har allt jag behöver. Ska jag skicka detta till Nordland VVS så att en tekniker kan höra av sig?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Inte än"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Välkommen tillbaka — kul att höra från dig igen; jag ser att vi har hjälpt dig tidigare. Tack Henrik Andersson! Jag har skickat dina uppgifter till Nordland VVS — de hör av sig på +46701234567 så snart de kan. Något mer jag kan hjälpa till med?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.2997875213623047, 0.9463381767272949, 0.03326106071472168, 0.02026987075805664, 10.855391502380371, 0.02094578742980957, 0.016788244247436523, 0.01706242561340332, 0.02105545997619629, 0.022043704986572266, 1.7078683376312256], "avg_latency_sec": 1.360073826529763, "wallclock_sec": 182.48049759864807, "error": null}
{"id": "R015", "category": "resolvable", "persona": "Rolf, 66, retired engineer", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "resolved", "expected_escalation_reason": null, "notes": "", "target_turns": 8, "turns_taken": 11, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "I don't know the model. It's an IVT ground source heat pump.", "serial": null, "problem": "Condensation on pipe — It's just condensation on the cold water pipe. No error codes. It's an IVT ground source unit.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Rolf Johansson", "email": "rolf.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46701112233", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 52 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 30, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "I don't know the model. It's an IVT ground source heat pump.", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 13, "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "payload_json": {"summary": "", "customer": {"name": "Rolf Johansson", "email": "rolf.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46701112233", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 52"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "I don't know the model. It's an IVT grou", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Identified discrepancy between customer's stated machine type (ground source) and documented machine type (IVT 490 exhaust_air)."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Condensation is building on the cold water pipe near my heat pump, want to make sure that's normal."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sorry, I didn't quite catch that. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Heat pump"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [{"value": "no_heat", "label": "No heat"}, {"value": "error_code", "label": "Error code on display"}, {"value": "noise", "label": "Strange noise"}, {"value": "leaking", "label": "Leaking"}, {"value": "high_bills", "label": "Higher bills"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Condensation on pipe"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "I don't know the model. It's an IVT ground source heat pump."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks for clarifying it's an IVT ground source heat pump. The documentation I have access to is specifically for the IVT 490 exhaust air heat pump. Since your unit is a ground source model, the information in my manual wouldn't be accurate for troubleshooting your system. Condensation on pipes can sometimes indicate different things depending on the type of heat pump and its installation. To make sure we address this correctly and safely for your specific ground source heat pump, I'll arrange for a Nordland technician to come out and take a look.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's just condensation on the cold water pipe. No error codes. It's an IVT ground source unit."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Rolf Johansson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-111 22 33"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "rolf.johansson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks Rolf Johansson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701112233 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.2373385429382324, 0.9150505065917969, 0.030098676681518555, 0.025438547134399414, 9.429065704345703, 0.01512455940246582, 0.015433073043823242, 0.02172565460205078, 0.01781773567199707, 0.016534805297851562, 0.7852334976196289], "avg_latency_sec": 1.137169209393588, "wallclock_sec": 411.56539368629456, "error": null}
{"id": "R013", "category": "resolvable", "persona": "Tobias, 33, precise", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "resolved", "expected_escalation_reason": null, "notes": "", "target_turns": 11, "turns_taken": 12, "final_state": null, "escalation_reason": null, "decision": null, "slots": null, "contact": null, "artifacts": {}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT Geo 412C, alarm A01 5378 on the display, no other symptoms."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sorry, I didn't quite catch that. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's a heat pump. An IVT Geo 412C."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "There's an alarm code A01 5378 on the display. Nothing else is wrong."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "Debe", "label": "Debe"}, {"value": "Grundfos", "label": "Grundfos"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT Geo 412C"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Hello there. The alarm code A01 5378 on your IVT Geo 412C indicates 'High pressure in the brine circuit'. Per your manual (Alarm list, p.32), a common cause is a closed shut-off valve in the brine circuit. Could you please check that all shut-off valves in the brine circuit are fully open? A handle in line with the pipe usually means it's open. Let me know what you find.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "The valves are all open."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thank you for checking that the valves are open. Since the shut-off valves are confirmed open, the next common cause for 'High pressure in the brine circuit' (A01 5378) is a clogged brine filter. Per your manual (Maintenance section, p.27), the brine filter should be cleaned regularly. Could you please locate and clean the brine filter according to the instructions in your manual? It's usually a simple process of rinsing it under water. Let me know if you need help finding the instructions.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm not sure where the brine filter is. Can you tell me?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Before I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "The alarm code is A01 5378. It's on the display. That's it."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Tobias Lindgren"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "tobias.lindgren@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.337977409362793, 0.8740410804748535, 0.018088340759277344, 0.022321224212646484, 10.851843118667603, 9.817561626434326, 11.956032514572144, 0.032727718353271484, 0.01521611213684082, 0.018385887145996094, 0.021730661392211914, 0.014838695526123047], "avg_latency_sec": 2.9150636990865073, "wallclock_sec": 470.7953097820282, "error": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\django\\db\\models\\query.py\", line 948, in get_or_create\n    return self.get(**kwargs), False\n           ~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\django\\db\\models\\query.py\", line 635, in get\n    raise self.model.DoesNotExist(\n        \"%s matching query does not exist.\" % self.model._meta.object_name\n    )\ncrm.models.ServiceRequest.DoesNotExist: ServiceRequest matching query does not exist.\n\nDuring handling of the above exception, another exception occurred:\n\nTraceback (most recent 