{"id": "R025", "category": "resolvable", "persona": "Patrik, 50, engineer type", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "resolved", "expected_escalation_reason": null, "notes": "", "target_turns": 8, "turns_taken": 9, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "decision", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "Geo 412C", "serial": null, "problem": "particle filter — The code is still H01 5252. I didn't take a photo, I just followed the steps you gave me.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": "H01 5252", "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Patrik Svensson", "email": "patrik.svensson@email.se", "phone": "+46705551234", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 22 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 40, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "Geo 412C", "error_code": "H01 5252", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 16, "escalation_reason": "decision", "payload_json": {"summary": "", "customer": {"name": "Patrik Svensson", "email": "patrik.svensson@email.se", "phone": "+46705551234", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 22"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "Geo 412C", "serial": "", "error_code": "H01 5252", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Guided customer through cleaning particle filter (manual p.21) for H01 5252 error.", "Customer reported cleaning did not resolve the error."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT Geo 412C shows H01 5252, I suspect the particle filter, can you confirm the steps?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "You're right to suspect the particle filter. The H01 5252 error code on your IVT Geo 412C indeed indicates that the particle filter is clogged. Your manual (page 39) confirms this and directs you to clean the filter. Here are the steps from page 21 of your manual:\n\n1.  Close the shut-off valves (1) and (2) on the brine side.\n2.  Open the cover (3) and remove the particle filter (4).\n3.  Clean the particle filter under running water.\n4.  Reinstall the particle filter and close the cover.\n5.  Open the shut-off valves (1) and (2).\n\nAfter cleaning and reassembling, the error code should clear. Cleaning this filter regularly helps maintain your heat pump's efficiency.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Okay, that seems straightforward enough. Thanks for the clear instructions."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "You're welcome! Please go ahead and follow those steps to clean the particle filter. Let me know once you've done that, and we can confirm if the H01 5252 error code has cleared.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Did that. The code is still there."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thank you for letting me know. Since you've already followed the steps on page 21 of your manual to clean the particle filter, and the H01 5252 error code is still present, it indicates that the issue might be more complex than just a clogged filter. The manual doesn't provide further user-serviceable steps for this particular error after cleaning the filter. This means a Nordland technician will need to investigate further to determine the root cause, which could be related to flow in the brine circuit or a sensor issue. I'll arrange for a Nordland technician to get in touch with you to schedule a service visit.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "The code is still H01 5252. I didn't take a photo, I just followed the steps you gave me."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Patrik Svensson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-555 12 34"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "patrik.svensson@email.se"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 22 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks Patrik Svensson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46705551234 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [10.92406678199768, 6.15208101272583, 10.361315727233887, 0.22092485427856445, 0.0