{"id": "R022", "category": "resolvable", "persona": "Linnea, 27, first apartment", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "resolved", "expected_escalation_reason": null, "notes": "", "target_turns": 10, "turns_taken": 1, "final_state": null, "escalation_reason": null, "decision": null, "slots": null, "contact": null, "artifacts": {}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "My IVT Vent 402 sounds rattly and airflow feels weak, not sure what to check."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "A rattling sound and weak airflow often indicate an issue with the fan or a blockage in the air ducts. Since your IVT Vent 402 is an exhaust air unit, it's important to ensure proper ventilation. The first thing we can check is the exhaust air filter, as a clogged filter can restrict airflow and cause the fan to work harder, leading to noise. According to your manual (Maintenance, p. 19), you should regularly clean the exhaust air filter. Can you please check if the exhaust air filter is clean? It's located behind the front cover.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}], "latencies_sec": [6.574071645736694], "avg_latency_sec": 6.574071645736694, "wallclock_sec": 199.99828505516052, "error": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in run_one\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 65, in _retry\n    return fn