{"id": "R031", "category": "resolvable", "persona": "Stefan, 64, retired plumber (still asks politely)", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "resolved", "expected_escalation_reason": null, "notes": "", "target_turns": 9, "turns_taken": 11, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "decision", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "IVT Geo 412C", "serial": null, "problem": "Error code on display — The display shows H01 5295. As I said, there's condensation on the pipes too.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Stefan Andersson", "email": "stefan.andersson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 52 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 46, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "IVT Geo 412C", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 19, "escalation_reason": "decision", "payload_json": {"summary": "", "customer": {"name": "Stefan Andersson", "email": "stefan.andersson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 52"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "IVT Geo 412C", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": "error_code", "troubleshooting_performed": ["Identified machine model: IVT Geo 412C.", "Identified error code: H01 5295 (High Pressure Alarm).", "Confirmed that the cause and resolution for this alarm are outside the safe envelope for customer troubleshooting."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "H01 5295 alarm, pipes have condensation, want to confirm this just needs acknowledging."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sorry, I didn't quite catch that. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's a heat pump. I'm seeing an H01 5295 alarm and some condensation on the pipes."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [{"value": "no_heat", "label": "No heat"}, {"value": "error_code", "label": "Error code on display"}, {"value": "noise", "label": "Strange noise"}, {"value": "leaking", "label": "Leaking"}, {"value": "high_bills", "label": "Higher bills"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Error code on display"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT Geo 412C"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thank you for providing the model number. The H01 5295 alarm on your IVT Geo 412C indicates a high pressure alarm (HP). This can be caused by several factors, and it's not something that just needs acknowledging. Condensation on the pipes could be related. To ensure safety and proper operation, this situation requires a technician to diagnose and resolve. I'll line up a Nordland technician to take a look at your system.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "The display shows H01 5295. As I said, there's condensation on the pipes too."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Stefan Andersson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "stefan.andersson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Stefan Andersson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701234567 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.3554086685180664, 1.010840654373169, 0.036400556564331055, 0.027799129486083984, 7.3038411140441895, 0.01807880401611328, 0.015997886657714844, 0.019374370574951172, 0.018970251083374023, 0.024967432022094727, 0.6578609943389893], "avg_latency_sec": 0.9535945328799161, "wallclock_sec": 153.66644549369812, "error": null}
