{"id": "R038", "category": "resolvable", "persona": "Petra, 42, organized", "language": "sv", "expected_outcome": "resolved", "expected_escalation_reason": null, "notes": "", "target_turns": 11, "turns_taken": 11, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "IVT Vent 402", "serial": null, "problem": "Ventilationen låter mer och luftflödet känns svagare, filtret kanske behöver bytas — Jag behöver inget nytt filter just nu, jag ville bara veta var jag kan köpa ett ifall det behövs. Problemet är som jag sa, att det låter mer och flödet är sämre. Ingen felkod.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Petra Karlsson", "email": "petra.karlsson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 22 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 53, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": null, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "IVT Vent 402", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 23, "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "payload_json": {"summary": "", "customer": {"name": "Petra Karlsson", "email": "petra.karlsson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 22"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "IVT Vent 402", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": "noise", "troubleshooting_performed": ["Advised customer on where to purchase replacement filter."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hej! Jag är Nordland VVS assistent. Jag kan hjälpa till med värmepumpar, vattenpumpar/brunnar och vattenfilter. Låt oss ta reda på vad som händer. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ventilationen låter mer och luftflödet känns svagare, filtret kanske behöver bytas."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket märke är det?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Annat / inte listat"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilken modell är det? Ett foto av typskylten är perfekt om du har ett.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "Jag vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT Vent 402"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Tack för att du bekräftade modellen. Att ventilationen låter mer och luftflödet känns svagare är ofta ett tecken på att filtret behöver bytas eller rengöras. Enligt manualen för IVT Vent 402 (Avsnitt 3.3, \"Skötsel och underhåll\", sidan 10) ska filtret rengöras regelbundet, minst en gång per kvartal, eller vid behov. Om filtret är mycket smutsigt kan det behöva bytas ut. \n\nFör att kontrollera och eventuellt byta filtret, följ dessa steg:\n\n1.  Öppna frontluckan på din IVT Vent 402.\n2.  Dra ut filterkassetten.\n3.  Kontrollera filtret. Om det är smutsigt, rengör det försiktigt med en dammsugare eller byt ut det mot ett nytt filter av samma typ.\n4.  Sätt tillbaka filterkassetten och stäng frontluckan.\n\nLåt mig veta hur det går efter att du har kontrollerat filtret.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Jag har kollat filtret, det ser ganska skitigt ut. Jag tror det behöver bytas."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Det låter som en bra bedömning. Ett smutsigt filter kan absolut leda till både ökat ljud och sämre luftflöde. Att byta ut det mot ett nytt filter av samma typ är nästa steg. När du har bytt filtret, kontrollera om ljudnivån och luftflödet återgår till det normala. Om problemet kvarstår efter filterbytet, hör av dig igen så tar vi det därifrån.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ok, jag ska beställa ett nytt filter. Var kan jag köpa ett?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Du kan beställa nya filter direkt från Nordland VVS. Vi har originalfilter som passar din IVT Vent 402. Kontakta oss via telefon eller besök vår hemsida för att lägga en beställning.\n\nInnan jag skickar detta vidare till en tekniker från Nordland VVS — beskriv gärna problemet lite mer i detalj, och om maskinen visar någon fel- eller larmkod, skicka en bild på displayen (det hjälper teknikern mycket). Finns ingen kod, säg bara till.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Jag behöver inget nytt filter just nu, jag ville bara veta var jag kan köpa ett ifall det behövs. Problemet är som jag sa, att det låter mer och flödet är sämre. Ingen felkod."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag vill gärna att en tekniker från Nordland VVS hjälper dig med detta. Får jag ta några uppgifter så de kan höra av sig — vad heter du?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Petra Karlsson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket telefonnummer når vi dig bäst på?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Och din e-post? (skriv 'skip' om du hellre avstår.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "petra.karlsson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Slutligen, vilket postnummer eller adress har du så vi kan skicka en tekniker?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 22 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag har allt jag behöver. Ska jag skicka detta till Nordland VVS så att en tekniker kan höra av sig?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Inte än"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Välkommen tillbaka — kul att höra från dig igen; jag ser att vi har hjälpt dig tidigare. Tack Petra Karlsson! Jag har skickat dina uppgifter till Nordland VVS — de hör av sig på +46701234567 så snart de kan. Något mer jag kan hjälpa till med?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.1544477939605713, 0.02300858497619629, 8.566028356552124, 4.9041993618011475, 3.7458629608154297, 0.01589798927307129, 0.015902042388916016, 0.02322554588317871, 0.016530990600585938, 0.01535654067993164, 0.7754302024841309], "avg_latency_sec": 1.750535488128662, "wallclock_sec": 125.72193574905396, "error": null}
{"id": "R033", "category": "resolvable", "persona": "Daniel, 40, efficient", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "resolved", "expected_escalation_reason": null, "notes": "", "target_turns": 11, "turns_taken": 7, "final_state": null, "escalation_reason": null, "decision": null, "slots": null, "contact": null, "artifacts": {}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Vent 402 filter probably needs cleaning, airflow dropped and it's noisier."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [{"value": "bad_taste", "label": "Bad taste/smell"}, {"value": "discoloured", "label": "Discoloured water"}, {"value": "low_flow", "label": "Low flow"}, {"value": "media_question", "label": "Salt/media question"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Airflow dropped and it's noisier."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT Vent 402"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "It sounds like the extract-air filter might be clogged, which can reduce airflow and increase noise. According to your IVT Vent 402 manual, page 14, under 'Maintenance', you should check and clean the extract-air filter regularly. To do this, switch off the heat pump at the main switch first. Then, open the front cover by pulling the lower edge outwards. Carefully slide out the filter and clean it. You can use a vacuum cleaner to remove dust and debris. Once clean, reinsert the filter and close the front cover. Finally, switch the heat pump back on. This should help restore proper airflow and reduce noise.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Okay, I'll try cleaning the filter. Thanks."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "You're welcome! Cleaning the extract-air filter is a great first step, as it often resolves issues with reduced airflow and increased noise. Let me know if you have any other questions after you've cleaned it. (Tip: Cleaning the filter every ~2 months prevents this.)", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's still making a bit of noise even after cleaning."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand you've cleaned the filter, but it's still making some noise. Since cleaning the filter didn't fully resolve the noise issue, and given that the problem involves reduced airflow and increased noise, it's best to have a Nordland technician examine the unit. There might be an underlying issue that requires professional attention. I'll line up a Nordland technician to take a look.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "No error codes showing. The noise sounds like a slight rattling when it kicks on."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.9689760208129883, 0.02567458152770996, 1.0183913707733154, 14.31733512878418, 4.17560601234436, 4.677938222885132, 0.02087879180908203], "avg_latency_sec": 3.743542875562395, "wallclock_sec": 420.9865641593933, "error": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in run_one\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 65, in _retry\n    return fn()\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in <lambda>\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n                               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\customer_sim.py\", line 99, in next_reply\n    resp = gemini.generate(\n        prompt,\n    ...<3 lines>...\n        temperature=0.8,\n    )\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\core\\services\\gemini.py\", line 196, in generate\n    resp = client.models.generate_content(model=model, contents=contents, config=cfg)\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\google\\genai\\models.py\", line 6488, in generate_content\n    response = self._generate_content(\n        model=model, contents=contents, config=parsed_config_to_call\n    )\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\google\\genai\\models.py\", line 4916, in _generate_content\n    response = self._api_client.request(\n        'post', path, request_dict, http_options\n    )\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\google\\genai\\_api_client.py\", line 1618, in reque