nt. Make sure it's completely dry before putting it back.\n5.  Insert the clean filter back into the unit.\n6.  Close the front cover.\n7.  Switch the heat pump back on at the main switch.\n\nPlease let me know if cleaning the filter helps with the rattling and airflow.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ok, I'll try that."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Great. Please let me know how it goes after you've cleaned the exhaust air filter and restarted the unit. If the rattling and weak airflow persist, we'll look into other possibilities.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}], "latencies_sec": [1.1401925086975098, 0.41504955291748047, 14.16092324256897, 3.4818344116210938], "avg_latency_sec": 4.799499928951263, "wallclock_sec": 219.47534823417664, "error": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in run_one\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 65, in _retry\n    return fn()\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in <lambda>\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n                               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\customer_sim.py\", line 99, in next_reply\n    resp = gemini.generate(\n        prompt,\n    ...<3 lines>...\n        temperature=0.8,\n    )\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\core\\services\\gemini.py\", line 196, in generate\n    resp = client.models.generate_content(model=model, contents=contents, config=cfg)\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\google\\ge