{"id": "R049", "category": "resolvable", "persona": "Robert, 43, calm engineer", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "resolved", "expected_escalation_reason": null, "notes": "", "target_turns": 12, "turns_taken": 10, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "decision", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "IVT Geo 412C", "serial": null, "problem": "moisture warning, pipes are a bit damp, want to confirm this clears itself — It's just the H01 5295 warning. The pipes are damp, that's all I see.", "category": "unknown", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": "H01 5295", "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Robert Johansson", "email": "robert.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 52 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 64, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "IVT Geo 412C", "error_code": "H01 5295", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 30, "escalation_reason": "decision", "payload_json": {"summary": "IVT Geo 412C heat pump shows H01 5295 moisture warning with damp pipes, indicating a leak that won't clear itself. Severity is service. No safe steps were tried. A Nordland technician needs to investigate and repair the leak; recommend booking a service visit. Contact captured: Robert Johansson, 070-123 45 67, robert.johansson@email.com, 111 52 Stockholm, and consent to be contacted confirmed.", "customer": {"name": "Robert Johansson", "email": "robert.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 52"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "IVT Geo 412C", "serial": "", "error_code": "H01 5295", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Identified error code H01 5295 as 'Moisture sensor alarm' from manual (p.42)", "Confirmed customer's symptoms ('moisture warning', 'damp pipes') align with the alarm"]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "H01 5295 moisture warning, pipes are a bit damp, want to confirm this clears itself."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sorry, I didn't quite catch that. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Heat pump."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "Debe", "label": "Debe"}, {"value": "Grundfos", "label": "Grundfos"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT Geo 412C"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "That H01 5295 error code means the heat pump's moisture sensor has detected moisture on the bottom plate of the unit. This aligns with what you're seeing with the damp pipes. As per your manual (Alarm list, p.42), this indicates a leak. It won't clear itself until the source of the moisture is found and fixed. This type of issue requires a Nordland technician to properly investigate and repair the leak. I'll line one up for you.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's just the H01 5295 warning. The pipes are damp, that's all I see."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Robert Johansson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "robert.johansson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Robert Johansson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701234567 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state"