: "assistant", "content": "I understand you're seeing low pressure on your heat pump's gauge and are concerned about adding water. Adjusting the pressure in the heating system involves interacting with the pressurized water circuit, which needs to be done by a qualified technician to ensure it's done safely and correctly. I'll line up a Nordland technician to take a look at your IVT 490 and address the low pressure for you.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "I don't see any error codes on the display. The needle is just in the red zone."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ingrid Johansson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "ingrid.johansson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Ingrid Johansson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701234567 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.4760181903839111, 0.6034502983093262, 0.015343904495239258, 0.01672983169555664, 10.192708253860474, 0.019073009490966797, 0.020612478256225586, 0.020653724670410156, 0.02377486228942871, 0.018207073211669922, 3.6604325771331787], "avg_latency_sec": 1.4606367457996716, "wallclock_sec": 138.40927386283875, "error": null}
