{"id": "E007", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Helena, 52, precise", "language": "sv", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "notes": "", "target_turns": 11, "turns_taken": 11, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "decision", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "Bosch", "model": "Bosch Greenline", "serial": null, "problem": "Min Bosch Greenline visar E21.RHP med jämna mellanrum, återkommer trots omstart. — Jag har redan sagt att den visar E21.RHP. Jag har också startat om den. Vad mer kan jag beskriva?", "category": "unknown", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Helena Karlsson", "email": "helena.karlsson@epost.se", "phone": "+46706543210", "consent": true, "postal_code": "123 45 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 72, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "Bosch", "model": "Bosch Greenline", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 32, "escalation_reason": "decision", "payload_json": {"summary": "Värmepump Bosch Greenline visar felkod E21.RHP periodvis, trots omstart. Felet indikerar att högtryckspressostaten löst ut, troligen p.g.a. problem med cirkulationspumpar eller igensatta smutsfilter. Kunden har redan startat om enheten. Rekommenderad åtgärd är att boka ett servicebesök för kontroll av cirkulationspumpar och filter. Kontaktuppgifter (namn, telefonnummer, e-post, adress) och samtycke till kontakt är inhämtade.", "customer": {"name": "Helena Karlsson", "email": "helena.karlsson@epost.se", "phone": "+46706543210", "address": "", "postal_code": "123 45"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "Bosch Greenline", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "Bosch"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Identified error code E21.RHP meaning (high-pressure pressostat tripped) from manual.", "Suggested customer try specific 'Återställ larm' button.", "Determined further steps (checking pumps, cleaning filters) are best handled by a technician due to valve manipulation and system interaction."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hej! Jag är Nordland VVS assistent. Jag kan hjälpa till med värmepumpar, vattenpumpar/brunnar och vattenfilter. Låt oss ta reda på vad som händer. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Min Bosch Greenline visar E21.RHP med jämna mellanrum, återkommer trots omstart."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Förlåt, jag uppfattade inte riktigt. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Det är en värmepump. En Bosch Greenline."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Okej. Beskriv kort vad problemet är.", "chips": [], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Min Bosch Greenline visar E21.RHP med jämna mellanrum, återkommer trots omstart."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket märke är det?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "Debe", "label": "Debe"}, {"value": "Grundfos", "label": "Grundfos"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Annat / inte listat"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Bosch"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilken modell är det? Ett foto av typskylten är perfekt om du har ett.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "Jag vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Bosch Greenline."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Hej! E21.RHP på din Bosch Greenline betyder att högtryckspressostaten har löst ut. Enligt manualen (avsnitt 9.2, Felkoder) beror detta ofta på att cirkulationspumparna inte går som de ska eller att smutsfiltren är igensatta.\n\nDu har redan provat att starta om, men jag vill be dig att specifikt trycka på knappen 'Återställ larm' på värmepumpens display. Om larmet återkommer efter det, behöver en tekniker titta närmare på det. Att kontrollera och rengöra smutsfiltren är en del av det årliga underhållet, men det involverar att stänga ventiler och öppna delar av systemet, vilket är bäst att en tekniker gör för att säkerställa att det utförs korrekt och säkert. Jag rekommenderar att vi bokar in en Nordland-tekniker som kan kontrollera cirkulationspumparna och smutsfiltren åt dig.\n\nInnan jag skickar detta vidare till en tekniker från Nordland VVS — beskriv gärna problemet lite mer i detalj, och om maskinen visar någon fel- eller larmkod, skicka en bild på displayen (det hjälper teknikern mycket). Finns ingen kod, säg bara till.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Jag har redan sagt att den visar E21.RHP. Jag har också startat om den. Vad mer kan jag beskriva?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag vill gärna att en tekniker från Nordland VVS hjälper dig med detta. Får jag ta några uppgifter så de kan höra av sig — vad heter du?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Helena Karlsson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket telefonnummer når vi dig bäst på?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-654 32 10"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Och din e-post? (skriv 'skip' om du hellre avstår.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "helena.karlsson@epost.se"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Slutligen, vilket postnummer eller adress har du så vi kan skicka en tekniker?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "123 45 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag har allt jag behöver. Ska jag skicka detta till Nordland VVS så att en tekniker kan höra av sig?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Inte än"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ja, skicka till Nordland."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Tack Helena Karlsson! Jag har skickat dina uppgifter till Nordland VVS — de hör av sig på +46706543210 så snart de kan. Något mer jag kan hjälpa till med?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.4804863929748535, 0.6451363563537598, 0.017508745193481445, 0.016691207885742188, 12.466270446777344, 0.44185519218444824, 0.027701854705810547, 0.017609834671020508, 0.01575326919555664, 0.014998435974121094, 1.61116361618042], "avg_latency_sec": 1.5231977592815051, "wallclock_sec": 104.13686752319336, "error": null}
{"id": "E005", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Fredrik, 43, persistent", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "budget", "notes": "", "target_turns": 15, "turns_taken": 7, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "Geo 412C", "serial": null, "problem": "keeps erroring — There's no code on the display. It just shows \"fel\" and then stops. What else can I do before calling someone out?", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Fredrik Johansson", "email": "fred.johansson@email.se", "phone": "+46701234567", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 52 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 70, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "Geo 412C", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 33, "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "payload_json": {"summary": "The customer has an IVT Geo 412C heat pump showing \"fel\" and then stopping, with no specific error code displayed. The problem is ongoing and has not been resolved by user troubleshooting. Severity is inferred as service due to the nature of heat pump errors. No safe steps were successfully tried. Recommend booking a service visit. Contact captured: Fredrik Johansson, 070-123 45 67, fred.johansson@email.se, 111 52 Stockholm, and consent to be contacted confirmed.", "customer": {"name": "Fredrik Johansson", "email": "fred.johansson@email.se", "phone": "+46701234567", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 52"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "Geo 412C", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": "error_code", "troubleshooting_performed": ["Customer reports unit 'keeps erroring' without a specific error code.", "Determined that without an error code or more specific symptoms, further safe troubleshooting steps are not possible."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "still not working, what else can I try, IVT Geo 412C keeps erroring"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand your IVT Geo 412C keeps erroring. Since there's no error code displayed, and the issue persists, it's best to have a Nordland technician examine the unit. There are many potential causes for a heat pump to error without a specific code, and most require specialized tools or access to internal components that are not safe for you to check. I'll arrange for a technician to come out and diagnose the problem safely and accurately.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "There's no code on the display. It just shows \"fel\" and then stops. What else can I do before calling someone out?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Fredrik Johansson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "fred.johansson@email.se"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Fredrik Johansson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701234567 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [5.769166469573975, 0.014972209930419922, 0.030015945434570312, 0.0229341983795166, 0.0156400203704834, 0.0219266414642334, 1.680140495300293], "avg_latency_sec": 1.079256568636213, "wallclock_sec": 182.76215434074402, "error": null}
{"id": "E010", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Claes, 54, engineer", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "notes": "", "target_turns": 14, "turns_taken": 7, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "Grundfos", "model": "SQ", "serial": null, "problem": "short-cycles every few seconds — No error codes. It just kicks on, runs for a second or two, then shuts off. Repeats constantly. I've already checked the pressure tank, it seems fine.", "category": "water_pump_well", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Claes Jansson", "email": "claes.jansson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "consent": true, "postal_code": "791 77 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 75, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "Grundfos", "model": "SQ", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 34, "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "payload_json": {"summary": "", "customer": {"name": "Claes Jansson", "email": "claes.jansson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "address": "", "postal_code": "791 77"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "SQ", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "Grundfos"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Assessed symptom 'short-cycling every few seconds'", "Confirmed no error code"]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Grundfos SQ short-cycles every few seconds, checked the obvious stuff already."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "A pump that short-cycles every few seconds, especially without an error code, often indicates an issue with the pressure tank or the pressure switch. This is not something I can guide you to fix yourself as it involves checking and potentially adjusting components within the sealed pressure system. I'll arrange for a Nordland technician to come out and diagnose this properly for you.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "No error codes. It just kicks on, runs for a second or two, then shuts off. Repeats constantly. I've already checked the pressure tank, it seems fine."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Claes Jansson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "claes.jansson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "791 77 Hedemora"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Claes Jansson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701234567 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [5.531468629837036, 0.02047419548034668, 0.015465736389160156, 0.0268707275390625, 0.016436100006103516, 0.015696048736572266, 0.6429080963134766], "avg_latency_sec": 0.8956170763288226, "wallclock_sec": 60.319108724594116, "error": null}
