}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT Geo 412C, high pressure alarm returned after cleaning the outdoor coil."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sorry, I didn't quite catch that. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's a heat pump. The IVT Geo 412C."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [{"value": "no_heat", "label": "No heat"}, {"value": "error_code", "label": "Error code on display"}, {"value": "noise", "label": "Strange noise"}, {"value": "leaking", "label": "Leaking"}, {"value": "high_bills", "label": "Higher bills"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Error code on display"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT Geo 412C"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand you're seeing an error code on the display of your IVT Geo 412C, but you haven't provided the specific code. Could you please tell me what the exact error code displayed on the unit is? This will help me check the manual for the correct troubleshooting steps.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "The display says high pressure alarm again."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Before I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "The display shows \"high pressure alarm\" again. I cleaned the outdoor coil yesterday but it came back."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Kjell Andersson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-789 12 34"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "kjell.a@email.se"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 22 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Kjell Andersson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46707891234 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": 