{"id": "E012", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Rasmus, 40, tenacious", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "budget", "notes": "", "target_turns": 10, "turns_taken": 4, "final_state": null, "escalation_reason": null, "decision": null, "slots": null, "contact": null, "artifacts": {}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Third time asking — still not fixed, tried the filter and the reset, what next?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's an IVT ground source heat pump."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sorry, I didn't quite catch that. Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's an IVT ground source heat pump. Are you even reading my messages?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "I told you it's an IVT ground source heat pump. I don't know the model number."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand this is frustrating, and you've already tried cleaning the filter and resetting the unit. To help you accurately, I need to be absolutely sure I'm looking at the right information for your specific heat pump. You mentioned it's an IVT ground source heat pump, but the information I have access to is for an IVT 490 exhaust air heat pump. These are different types of systems, and the troubleshooting steps would be very different.\n\nSince we can't confirm the exact model number of your ground source heat pump, and you've already tried the general steps, the safest and most effective next step is to have a Nordland technician come out. They'll be able to identify your specific model and diagnose the issue directly. I'll arrange for a Nordland technician to contact you to schedule a visit.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.0755479335784912, 0.6434159278869629, 0.8715481758117676, 8.70405101776123], "avg_latency_sec": 2.823640763759613, "wallclock_sec": 263.3702323436737, "error": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in run_one\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 65, in _retry\n    return fn()\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in <lambda>\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n                               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\customer_sim.py\", line 99, in next_reply\n    resp = gemini.generate(\n        prompt,\n    ...<3 lines>...\n        temperature=0.8,\n    )\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\cor