{"id": "E016", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Åke, 57, calm but stuck", "language": "sv", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "notes": "", "target_turns": 14, "turns_taken": 8, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "forbidden term: köldmediekretsen", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "E21.RLP", "serial": null, "problem": "dyker upp titt som tätt, ingen tydlig mönster, provat starta om flera gånger — Det är E21.RLP som jag sa. Den dyker upp ibland, sen försvinner den. Inga andra koder.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Åke Svensson", "email": "ake.svensson@mail.com", "phone": "+46705551234", "consent": true, "postal_code": "123 45 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 81, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "E21.RLP", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 37, "escalation_reason": "forbidden term: köldmediekretsen", "payload_json": {"summary": "IVT värmepump (modell och serienummer ej specificerat) visar felkod E21.RLP sporadiskt, utan tydligt mönster. Kunden har provat att starta om enheten flera gånger utan resultat. Problemet bedöms som service då felkoden indikerar ett potentiellt driftstopp. Kunden har angett namn (Åke Svensson), telefonnummer (070-555 12 34), e-post (ake.svensson@mail.com) och adress (123 45 Gustavsberg), samt gett samtycke till att bli kontaktad. Nästa steg är att boka ett servicebesök.", "customer": {"name": "Åke Svensson", "email": "ake.svensson@mail.com", "phone": "+46705551234", "address": "", "postal_code": "123 45"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "E21.RLP", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": "error_code", "troubleshooting_performed": ["Identified error code E21.RLP and its meaning from the IVT 490 manual.", "Determined that the cause (low refrigerant pressure) requires professional intervention due to involving the sealed refrigerant circuit."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hej! Jag är Nordland VVS assistent. Jag kan hjälpa till med värmepumpar, vattenpumpar/brunnar och vattenfilter. Låt oss ta reda på vad som händer. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "E21.RLP dyker upp titt som tätt, ingen tydlig mönster, provat starta om flera gånger."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket märke är det?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Annat / inte listat"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Det är en IVT."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Innan jag skickar detta vidare till en tekniker från Nordland VVS — beskriv gärna problemet lite mer i detalj, och om maskinen visar någon fel- eller larmkod, skicka en bild på displayen (det hjälper teknikern mycket). Finns ingen kod, säg bara till.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Det är E21.RLP som jag sa. Den dyker upp ibland, sen försvinner den. Inga andra koder."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag vill gärna att en tekniker från Nordland VVS hjälper dig med detta. Får jag ta några uppgifter så de kan höra av sig — vad heter du?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Åke Svensson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket telefonnummer når vi dig bäst på?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-555 12 34"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Och din e-post? (skriv 'skip' om du hellre avstår.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "ake.svensson@mail.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Slutligen, vilket postnummer eller adress har du så vi kan skicka en tekniker?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "123 45 Gustavsberg"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag har allt jag behöver. Ska jag skicka detta till Nordland VVS så att en tekniker kan höra av sig?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Inte än"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Välkommen tillbaka — kul att höra från dig igen; jag ser att vi har hjälpt dig tidigare. Tack Åke Svensson! Jag har skickat dina uppgifter till Nordland VVS — de hör av sig på +46705551234 så snart de kan. Något mer jag kan hjälpa till med?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.0390329360961914, 9.89669919013977, 0.01568460464477539, 0.018769025802612305, 0.02178478240966797, 0.015557527542114258, 0.01621866226196289, 1.477715253829956], "avg_latency_sec": 1.5626827478408813, "wallclock_sec": 67.12363076210022, "error": null}
{"id": "E017", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Nina, 44, concerned", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "decision", "notes": "", "target_turns": 15, "turns_taken": 11, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "unknown", "serial": null, "problem": "The pressure gauge is reading low. — The gauge is just reading low, no error codes or anything. I'm just worried about the pressure.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Nina Johansson", "email": "nina.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46705551234", "consent": true, "postal_code": "755 93 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 82, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": null, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "unknown", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 38, "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "payload_json": {"summary": "", "customer": {"name": "Nina Johansson", "email": "nina.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46705551234", "address": "", "postal_code": "755 93"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "unknown", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Assessed symptom: low pressure gauge reading.", "Identified lack of specific model information."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "The heat pump pressure gauge reads low, I don't want to guess at refilling it myself."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [{"value": "no_heat", "label": "No heat"}, {"value": "error_code", "label": "Error code on display"}, {"value": "noise", "label": "Strange noise"}, {"value": "leaking", "label": "Leaking"}, {"value": "high_bills", "label": "Higher bills"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "The pressure gauge is reading low."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's an IVT."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sorry, I didn't quite catch that. Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "I don't know the model, sorry."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand the pressure gauge on your IVT heat pump is reading low. Since we don't have the specific model number for your unit, I can't look up the exact steps in your manual. Issues with system pressure often require a technician to safely diagnose and address, as they involve parts of the system that shouldn't be handled without specific training and tools. I'll line up a Nordland technician to take a proper look for you.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "The gauge is just reading low, no error codes or anything. I'm just worried about the pressure."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Nina Johansson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-555 12 34"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "nina.johansson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "755 93 Uppsala"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, please send it to Nordland."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Nina Johansson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46705551234 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.4800302982330322, 0.032012224197387695, 0.6019442081451416, 0.020433902740478516, 8.452173471450806, 0.01902604103088379, 0.017525672912597656, 0.030805110931396484, 0.016504287719726562, 0.014306068420410156, 0.8138325214385986], "avg_latency_sec": 1.0453267097473145, "wallclock_sec": 94.63162612915039, "error": null}
{"id": "E008", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Örjan, 48, frustrated", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "notes": "", "target_turns": 12, "turns_taken": 11, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "decision", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "IVT Geo 412C", "serial": null, "problem": "Error code on display — I already told you, it's H01 5292. And I've cleaned the filter twice already. It keeps coming back.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Örjan Johansson", "email": "orjan.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46705551234", "consent": true, "postal_code": "123 45 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 73, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "IVT Geo 412C", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 39, "escalation_reason": "decision", "payload_json": {"summary": "", "customer": {"name": "Örjan Johansson", "email": "orjan.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46705551234", "address": "", "postal_code": "123 45"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "IVT Geo 412C", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": "error_code", "troubleshooting_performed": ["Identified error code H01 5292 as compressor starting capacitor fault based on IVT Geo 412C manual."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Cleaned the filter twice, alarm H01 5292 still comes back within a day."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sorry, I didn't quite catch that. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's my heat pump. The alarm code is H01 5292."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [{"value": "no_heat", "label": "No heat"}, {"value": "error_code", "label": "Error code on display"}, {"value": "noise", "label": "Strange noise"}, {"value": "leaking", "label": "Leaking"}, {"value": "high_bills", "label": "Higher bills"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Error code on display"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "I think it's an IVT Geo 412C."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thank you for confirming your model is an IVT Geo 412C. The H01 5292 error code indicates a fault with the compressor's starting capacitor. This is an internal electrical component that requires a qualified technician to inspect and replace. I'll arrange for a Nordland technician to visit and resolve this for you.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "I already told you, it's H01 5292. And I've cleaned the filter twice already. It keeps coming back."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Örjan Johansson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-555 12 34"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "orjan.johansson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "123 45 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Örjan Johansson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46705551234 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.5394432544708252, 1.1026675701141357, 0.02594590187072754, 0.06425333023071289, 6.018310785293579, 0.017706871032714844, 0.02276134490966