{"id": "E015", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Frida, 35, direct", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "notes": "", "target_turns": 13, "turns_taken": 11, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "forbidden term: pre-charge", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "Debe", "model": "unknown", "serial": null, "problem": "Pump runs constantly — No error codes. It just keeps cycling.", "category": "water_pump_well", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Frida Johansson", "email": "frida.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46705551234", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 52 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 80, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "Debe", "model": "unknown", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 40, "escalation_reason": "forbidden term: pre-charge", "payload_json": {"summary": "Debe DPM pump is running constantly and not holding pressure, with no error codes shown; severity is service. The customer confirmed the discharge isolation valve is fully open. Recommend booking a service visit. Contact captured: Frida Johansson, 070-555 12 34, frida.johansson@email.com, 111 52 Stockholm, and consent to be contacted confirmed.", "customer": {"name": "Frida Johansson", "email": "frida.johansson@email.com", "phone": "+46705551234", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 52"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "unknown", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "Debe"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Customer reported pump runs constantly, not holding pressure, no obvious leaks.", "Customer confirmed discharge isolation valve is fully open.", "Assessed symptoms point to pressure switch or pressure tank pre-charge issues, which are outside safe customer troubleshooting."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Debe DPM pump won't hold pressure, cycles constantly, already checked for obvious leaks."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [{"value": "no_water", "label": "No water"}, {"value": "low_pressure", "label": "Low pressure"}, {"value": "runs_constantly", "label": "Pump runs constantly"}, {"value": "wont_start", "label": "Pump won't start"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Pump runs constantly"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Debe", "label": "Debe"}, {"value": "Grundfos", "label": "Grundfos"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Debe"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "I don't know the model offhand."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand your Debe DPM pump is running constantly and not holding pressure, and you've already looked for obvious leaks. This often points to a few common issues. Since you don't have the model number handy, we'll start with general checks that are safe for you to perform.\n\nFirst, let's confirm the basics. Could you tell me if the main isolation valve on the discharge side of the pump (the pipe leading away from the pump towards your house) is fully open? The handle should be in line with the pipe for it to be open. Sometimes, if this valve isn't fully open, the pump can struggle to build and maintain pressure.", "chips": [], "state": "SPECIALIST", "decision": "solve"}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's fully open. I already checked that."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Before I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "No error codes. It just keeps cycling."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Frida Johansson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-555 12 34"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "frida.johansson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Frida Johansson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46705551234 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.455998420715332, 0.2958517074584961, 0.0222780704498291, 10.480468511581421, 8.415107011795044, 0.014688968658447266, 0.022253036499023438, 0.019113540649414062, 0.01654219627380371, 0.019305706024169922, 1.4768009185791016], "avg_latency_sec": 2.021673462607644, "wallclock_sec": 179.90378260612488, "error": null}
