{"id": "E018", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Torbjörn, 61, tired of it", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "budget", "notes": "", "target_turns": 10, "turns_taken": 11, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "I don't know the model. It's an IVT ground source heat pump.", "serial": null, "problem": "Error code on display — I told you, it's the same alarm as before. Third day now. Just send someone.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Torbjörn Andersson", "email": "torbjorn.andersson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 52 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 83, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": null, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "I don't know the model. It's an IVT ground source heat pump.", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 42, "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "payload_json": {"summary": "The customer, Torbjörn Andersson, reports a recurring alarm on his IVT ground source heat pump, which has been happening for three days. No specific error code was provided, but the customer insists on a technician visit. The severity is inferred as service due to the persistent alarm and customer's request for a visit. The chat did not suggest any safe troubleshooting steps. A Nordland VVS technician visit is recommended. Contact details (phone: 070-123 45 67, email: torbjorn.andersson@email.com, address: 111 52 Stockholm) and consent to contact were captured.", "customer": {"name": "Torbjörn Andersson", "email": "torbjorn.andersson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 52"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "I don't know the model. It's an IVT grou", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Identified mismatch between user's reported heat pump type (ground source) and available documentation (exhaust air).", "Noted contradictory information regarding the presence of an error code."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Same alarm keeps returning no matter what I clean, this is the third day."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sorry, I didn't quite catch that. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's my heat pump. This alarm is driving me mad."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [{"value": "no_heat", "label": "No heat"}, {"value": "error_code", "label": "Error code on display"}, {"value": "noise", "label": "Strange noise"}, {"value": "leaking", "label": "Leaking"}, {"value": "high_bills", "label": "Higher bills"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Error code on display"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "I don't know the model. It's an IVT ground source heat pump."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand this recurring alarm is frustrating. However, you've mentioned your heat pump is a ground source model, and the documentation I have access to is specifically for the IVT IVT 490 exhaust air heat pump. These are different types of systems, and I can't safely give you troubleshooting steps from a manual that doesn't match your specific machine. To ensure accuracy and safety, I'll line up a Nordland technician to take a proper look. When they arrive, please show them the exact error code displayed, as that will be very helpful for their diagnosis.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "I told you, it's the same alarm as before. Third day now. Just send someone."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Torbjörn Andersson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "torbjorn.andersson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Torbjörn Andersson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701234567 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.744389295578003, 1.3065364360809326, 0.024396896362304688, 0.021695613861083984, 10.347045183181763, 0.020923376083374023, 0.06808733940124512, 0.0661160945892334, 0.27559781074523926, 0.13450336456298828, 3.8854939937591553], "avg_latency_sec": 1.6267986731095747, "wallclock_sec": 268.583692073822, "error": null}
{"id": "E022", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Lennart, 71, elderly persistent", "language": "sv", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "budget", "notes": "", "target_turns": 14, "turns_taken": 5, "final_state": null, "escalation_reason": null, "decision": null, "slots": null, "contact": null, "artifacts": {}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hej! Jag är Nordland VVS assistent. Jag kan hjälpa till med värmepumpar, vattenpumpar/brunnar och vattenfilter. Låt oss ta reda på vad som händer. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Provade allt du föreslog men larmet dyker upp igen efter någon timme."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Förlåt, jag uppfattade inte riktigt. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Det är värmepumpen det gäller. IVT Geo 412C."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Okej. Beskriv kort vad problemet är.", "chips": [], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Det är larmet som kommer tillbaka hela tiden. Jag har gjort allt ni sa men det hjälper inte."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket märke är det?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "Debe", "label": "Debe"}, {"value": "Grundfos", "label": "Grundfos"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Annat / inte listat"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilken modell är det? Ett foto av typskylten är perfekt om du har ett.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "Jag vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Det är en IVT Geo 412C. Jag sa ju det förut."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag förstår att larmet kommer tillbaka på din IVT Geo 412C och att du redan har provat de åtgärder vi diskuterat. Eftersom problemet kvarstår och du inte har någon specifik felkod att rapportera, behöver en Nordland-tekniker titta på din värmepump för att diagnostisera och åtgärda problemet på plats. Jag kan boka in en tekniker åt dig.\n\nInnan jag skickar detta vidare till en tekniker från Nordland VVS — beskriv gärna problemet lite mer i detalj, och om maskinen visar någon fel- eller larmkod, skicka en bild på displayen (det hjälper teknikern mycket). Finns ingen kod, säg bara till.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.4750730991363525, 0.7540221214294434, 0.01679849624633789, 0.016086816787719727, 6.08641791343689], "avg_latency_sec": 1.6696796894073487, "wallclock_sec": 219.16491532325745, "error": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in run_one\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 65, in _retry\n    return fn()\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in <lambda>\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n                               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\customer_sim.py\", line 99, in next_reply\n    resp = gemini.generate(\n        prompt,\n    ...<3 lines>...\n        temperature=