{"id": "E028", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Håkan, 49, farmer", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "notes": "", "target_turns": 14, "turns_taken": 11, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "Grundfos", "model": "unknown", "serial": null, "problem": "It's short cycling. — It's just cycling on and off too fast. No error codes or anything.", "category": "water_pump_well", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Håkan Andersson", "email": "hakan.andersson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "consent": true, "postal_code": "774 61 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 93, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "Grundfos", "model": "unknown", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 43, "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "payload_json": {"summary": "", "customer": {"name": "Håkan Andersson", "email": "hakan.andersson@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "address": "", "postal_code": "774 61"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "unknown", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "Grundfos"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Attempted to identify machine model; model remains unknown", "Customer reported 'short cycling' and 'pressure tank check' already performed"]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Well pump short-cycles, tried the pressure tank check you mentioned, no change."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sorry, I didn't quite catch that. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Water pump / well"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [{"value": "no_water", "label": "No water"}, {"value": "low_pressure", "label": "Low pressure"}, {"value": "runs_constantly", "label": "Pump runs constantly"}, {"value": "wont_start", "label": "Pump won't start"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's short cycling."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Which brand is it?", "chips": [{"value": "Debe", "label": "Debe"}, {"value": "Grundfos", "label": "Grundfos"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Other / not listed"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Grundfos"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "I don't know the model. It's an older Grundfos."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand your Grundfos well pump is short cycling. Since we don't have the specific model number for your older Grundfos pump, I can't confidently look up the exact troubleshooting steps in the manuals I have. Short cycling can be caused by several things, and without knowing the specific model, I can't guide you through safe, documented checks. For this reason, I recommend having a Nordland technician come out to properly diagnose the issue. I can arrange for one to contact you.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's just cycling on and off too fast. No error codes or anything."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Håkan Andersson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "hakan.andersson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "774 61 Avesta"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Håkan Andersson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701234567 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.351717233657837, 0.9612348079681396, 0.04064321517944336, 0.02021169662475586, 9.081191301345825, 0.013897180557250977, 0.014902114868164062, 0.05166292190551758, 0.017957448959350586, 0.02585148811340332, 0.6486690044403076], "avg_latency_sec": 1.111630764874545, "wallclock_sec": 83.25752520561218, "error": null}
{"id": "E023", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Gerd, 65, elderly worried", "language": "sv", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "notes": "", "target_turns": 15, "turns_taken": 8, "final_state": null, "escalation_reason": null, "decision": null, "slots": null, "contact": null, "artifacts": {}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hej! Jag är Nordland VVS assistent. Jag kan hjälpa till med värmepumpar, vattenpumpar/brunnar och vattenfilter. Låt oss ta reda på vad som händer. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Pumpen klickar på och av var femte sekund, testade återställa säkringen."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Förlåt, jag uppfattade inte riktigt. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Det är en värmepump."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Okej. Beskriv kort vad problemet är.", "chips": [{"value": "no_heat", "label": "Ingen värme"}, {"value": "error_code", "label": "Felkod på displayen"}, {"value": "noise", "label": "Konstigt ljud"}, {"value": "leaking", "label": "Läcker"}, {"value": "high_bills", "label": "Högre räkningar"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Konstigt ljud"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket märke är det?", "chips": [{"value": "Bosch", "label": "Bosch"}, {"value": "IVT", "label": "IVT"}, {"value": "other", "label": "Annat / inte listat"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "IVT"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilken modell är det? Ett foto av typskylten är perfekt om du har ett.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "Jag vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Jag vet inte riktigt vilken modell det är."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "För att kunna hjälpa dig på bästa sätt och ge dig korrekta råd behöver jag veta exakt vilken modell din IVT värmepump är. Utan den informationen kan jag tyvärr inte ge dig specifika felsökningssteg från manualen för just din maskin. Att pumpen klickar på och av var femte sekund och låter konstigt är tecken på att något inte fungerar som det ska. Jag rekommenderar att en Nordland-tekniker tittar på detta för att diagnostisera problemet säkert och korrekt. Jag kan boka in en tekniker åt dig.\n\nInnan jag skickar detta vidare till en tekniker från Nordland VVS — beskriv gärna problemet lite mer i detalj, och om maskinen visar någon fel- eller larmkod, skicka en bild på displayen (det hjälper teknikern mycket). Finns ingen kod, säg bara till.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Den verkar ju gå sönder, det är därför jag ringer! Den klickar och låter konstigt. Ingen display på den."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag vill gärna att en tekniker från Nordland VVS hjälper dig med detta. Får jag ta några uppgifter så de kan höra av sig — vad heter du?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Gerd Svensson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket telefonnummer når vi dig bäst på?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Och din e-post? (skriv 'skip' om du hellre avstår.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.2477095127105713, 0.8621799945831299, 0.031027555465698242, 0.035587310