lp with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Patrick Lundqvist"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "patrick.lundqvist@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "171 51 Solna"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Patrick Lundqvist! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701234567 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.5038065910339355, 0.5683169364929199, 0.01867961883544922, 6.03509783744812, 0.017574787139892578, 0.015572547912597656, 0.016855955123901367, 0.020568132400512695, 0.01620197296142578, 0.7585744857788086], "avg_latency_sec": 0.8971248865127563, "wallclock_sec": 120.82932209968567, "error": null}
{"id": "E037", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Yasmin, 26, new homeowner", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "notes": "", "target_turns": 11, "turns_taken": 7, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "Geo 412C", "serial": null, "problem": "Alarm returned after cleaning like you suggested, feels like a loop. — There's no error code on the display, it just keeps showing the same alarm symbol. It's like it's stuck.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Yasmin Eriksson", "email": "yasmin.eriksson@email.com", "phone": "+46709876543", "consent": true, "postal_code": "171 54 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 102, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "normal", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "Geo 412C", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 49, "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "payload_json": {"summary": "IVT Geo 412C heat pump, no error code given, shows a persistent alarm symbol. The alarm returned after cleaning, suggesting a more complex issue than routine maintenance, so severity is inferred as service. The customer confirmed cleaning was done without success and the unit is stuck showing the alarm symbol. Recommend booking a service visit. Contact details captured: Yasmin Eriksson, 070-987 65 43, yasmin.eriksson@email.com, 171 54 Solna, and consent to contact confirmed.", "customer": {"name": "Yasmin Eriksson", "email": "yasmin.eriksson@email.com", "phone": "+46709876543", "address": "", "postal_code": "171 54"}, "severity": "normal", "equipment": {"model": "Geo 412C", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Customer reported recurring alarm after previous cleaning, with no specific error code.", "Determined that further troubleshooting without an error code or more detailed symptoms would require technician intervention."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Alarm returned after cleaning like you suggested, IVT Geo 412C, feels like a loop."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand the alarm has returned even after cleaning. Since there is no specific error code displayed, and the previous cleaning didn't resolve the issue, it suggests the problem might be more complex than routine maintenance. This situation requires a more in-depth check by a qualified technician. I'll line up a Nordland technician to take a look at your IVT Geo 412C.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "There's no error code on the display, it just keeps showing the same alarm symbol. It's like it's stuck."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yasmin Eriksson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-987 65 43"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "yasmin.eriksson@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "171 54 Solna"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Yasmin Eriksson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46709876543 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [7.07610297203064, 0.02123856544494629, 0.015449047088623047, 0.024013996124267578, 0.018089771270751953, 0.02058124542236328, 1.4458446502685547], "avg_latency_sec": 1.2316171782357352, "wallclock_sec": 70.73221731185913, "error": null}
{"id": "E031", "category": "escalate", "persona": "Kerstin, 68, elderly", "language": "sv", "expected_outcome": "escalated_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "notes": "", "target_turns": 11, "turns_taken": 3, "final_state": null, "escalation_reason": null, "decision": null, "slots": null, "contact": null, "artifacts": {}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hej! Jag är Nordland VVS assistent. Jag kan hjälpa till med värmepumpar, vattenpumpar/brunnar och vattenfilter. Låt oss ta reda på vad som händer. Till att börja med, vilken typ av utrustning gäller det?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Värmepump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Vattenpump / brunn"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Vattenfilter"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Vet inte"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "Grundfos-pumpen far igång och stannar var tionde sekund, testat det du sa."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilken modell är det? Ett foto av typskylten är perfekt om du har ett.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "Jag vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Jag vet inte exakt vad det är för modell. Det är en Grundfos pump."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag förstår att pumpen startar och stannar var tionde sekund. Det låter som att pumpen kortcyklar. Utan att veta exakt vilken modell av Grundfos-pump det är, kan jag inte ge dig specifika instruktioner från manualen. Kortcykling beror ofta på problem med tryckkärlet, till exempel att lufttrycket är för lågt, eller att det finns en läcka någonstans i systemet. Dessa typer av problem kräver en tekniker för att diagnostisera och åtgärda säkert. Jag kan ordna så att en Nordland-tekniker kommer ut och tittar på din pump.\n\nInnan jag skickar detta vidare till en tekniker från Nordland VVS — beskriv gärna problemet lite mer i detalj, och om maskinen visar någon fel- eller larmkod, skicka en bild på displayen (det hjälper teknikern mycket). Finns ingen kod, säg bara till.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Nej, det är ingen felkod på displayen. Den bara hoppar igång och stannar, om och om igen."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag vill gärna att en tekniker från Nordland VVS hjälper dig med detta. Får jag ta några uppgifter så de kan höra av sig — vad heter du?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [1.231595516204834, 10.185704946517944, 0.024845600128173828], "avg_latency_sec": 3.814048687616984, "wallclock_sec": 303.05010747909546, "error": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in run_one\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 65, in _retry\n    return fn()\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\runner.py\", line 166, in <lambda>\n    user_text = _retry(lambda: customer_sim.next_reply(spec, hist, bot_msg, chips=chips))\n                               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\tools\\eval\\customer_sim.py\", line 99, in next_reply\n    resp = gemini.generate(\n        prompt,\n    ...<3 lines>...\n        temperature=0.8,\n    )\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\core\\services\\gemini.py\", line 196, in generate\n    resp = client.models.generate_content(model=model, contents=contents, config=cfg)\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\google\\genai\\models.py\", line 6488, in generate_content\n    response = self._generate_content(\n        model=model, contents=contents, config=parsed_config_to_call\n    )\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\google\\genai\\models.py\", line 4916, in _generate_content\n    response = self._api_client.request(\n        'post', path, request_dict, http_options\n    )\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\google\\genai\\_api_client.py\", line 1618, in request\n    response = self._request(http_request, http_options, stream=False)\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\google\\genai\\_api_client.py\", line 1411, in _request\n    return self._retry(self._request_once, http_request, stream)  # type: ignore[no-any-return]\n           ~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\tenacity\\__init__.py\", line 470, in __call__\n    do = self.iter(retry_state=retry_state)\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\tenacity\\__init__.py\", line 371, in iter\n    result = action(retry_state)\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\tenacity\\__init__.py\", line 413, in exc_check\n    raise retry_exc.reraise()\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\tenacity\\__init__.py\", line 184, in reraise\n    raise self.last_attempt.result()\n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\AppData\\Roaming\\uv\\python\\cpython-3.13.9-windows-x86_64-none\\Lib\\concurrent\\futures\\_base.py\", line 449, in result\n    return self.__get_result()\n           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\AppData\\Roaming\\uv\\python\\cpython-3.13.9-windows-x86_64-none\\Lib\\concurrent\\futures\\_base.py\", line 401, in __get_result\n    raise self._exception\n  File \"C:\\Users\\vladi\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\swedish-bot\\.venv\\Lib\\site-packages\\tenacity\\__init__.py\", line 473, in __call__\n    result =