 "content": "Har en Panasonic luft-luftvärmepump som visar felkod H90, kan ni hjälpa?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilken modell är det? Ett foto av typskylten är perfekt om du har ett.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "Jag vet inte"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "Jag vet inte modellen exakt, men den är några år gammal."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Tack för informationen. Eftersom jag inte har tillgång till manualer för just den modellen, vill jag inte riskera att ge felaktiga råd. Jag kommer att se till att en Nordland-tekniker tar hand om ditt ärende. Du är i goda händer.\n\nInnan jag skickar detta vidare till en tekniker från Nordland VVS — beskriv gärna problemet lite mer i detalj, och om maskinen visar någon fel- eller larmkod, skicka en bild på displayen (det hjälper teknikern mycket). Finns ingen kod, säg bara till.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Felkoden är H90. Den har visat det i några dagar nu."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag vill gärna att en tekniker från Nordland VVS hjälper dig med detta. Får jag ta några uppgifter så de kan höra av sig — vad heter du?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Karl-Johan Svensson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Vilket telefonnummer når vi dig bäst på?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Och din e-post? (skriv 'skip' om du hellre avstår.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "karljohan.svensson@epost.se"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Slutligen, vilket postnummer eller adress har du så vi kan skicka en tekniker?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jag har allt jag behöver. Ska jag skicka detta till Nordland VVS så att en tekniker kan höra av sig?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Inte än"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ja, skicka till Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Välkommen tillbaka — kul att höra från dig igen; jag ser att vi har hjälpt dig tidigare. Tack Karl-Johan Svensson! Jag har skickat dina uppgifter till Nordland VVS — de hör av sig på +46701234567 så snart de kan. Något mer jag kan hjälpa till med?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [6.554307222366333, 4.740503787994385, 2.2548933029174805, 0.035750389099121094, 0.02886486053466797, 0.02439117431640625, 0.01952338218688965, 0.9486889839172363], "avg_latency_sec": 1.825865387916565, "wallclock_sec": 1837.342122554779, "error": null}
{"id": "U004", "category": "unsupported", "persona": "Bengt, 74, elderly", "language": "en", "expected_outcome": "unsupported_lead", "expected_escalation_reason": "unsupported", "notes": "", "target_turns": 12, "turns_taken": 9, "final_state": "RESOLVED", "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "decision": "escalate", "slots": {"brand": "IVT", "model": "The model plate is so worn, I can't read it anymore. It's an IVT though.", "serial": null, "problem": "It's not heating properly. The house is getting cold. — There's no error code on the display. It just doesn't seem to be pushing out warm air like it used to.", "category": "heat_pump", "ocr_text": null, "error_code": null, "nameplate_photo": false}, "contact": {"name": "Bengt Svensson", "email": "bengt.svensson.74@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "consent": true, "postal_code": "111 52 "}, "artifacts": {"session_id": 111, "session_status": "escalated", "session_resolved": false, "session_severity": "urgent", "decision": "escalate", "manufacturer": "IVT", "model": "The model plate is so worn, I can't read it anymore. It's an IVT though.", "error_code": "", "service_request_count": 1, "service_requests": [{"id": 54, "escalation_reason": "low_confidence", "payload_json": {"summary": "IVT heat pump (model from 90s, not captured) has no error code but is not heating properly, causing the house to get cold. Severity is urgent. No safe steps were tried. Recommend booking a service visit. Contact captured: Bengt Svensson, 070-123 45 67, bengt.svensson.74@email.com, 111 52 Stockholm, and consent to be contacted confirmed.", "customer": {"name": "Bengt Svensson", "email": "bengt.svensson.74@email.com", "phone": "+46701234567", "address": "", "postal_code": "111 52"}, "severity": "urgent", "equipment": {"model": "The model plate is so worn, I can't read", "serial": "", "error_code": "", "manufacturer": "IVT"}, "problem_category": null, "troubleshooting_performed": ["Attempted to identify machine model; customer unable to provide due to worn nameplate.", "Assessed symptoms ('not heating properly', 'house getting cold') without error code."]}}]}, "transcript": [{"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi! I'm Nordland VVS's assistant. I can help with heat pumps, water pumps/wells and water filtration. Let's figure out what's going on. To start, what kind of equipment is it?", "chips": [{"value": "heat_pump", "label": "Heat pump"}, {"value": "water_pump_well", "label": "Water pump / well"}, {"value": "water_filtration", "label": "Water filtration"}, {"value": "unknown", "label": "Not sure"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": "I have a very old IVT heat pump from the 90s, model plate is worn."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Got it. In a few words, what's the problem?", "chips": [{"value": "no_heat", "label": "No heat"}, {"value": "error_code", "label": "Error code on display"}, {"value": "noise", "label": "Strange noise"}, {"value": "leaking", "label": "Leaking"}, {"value": "high_bills", "label": "Higher bills"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "It's not heating properly. The house is getting cold."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the model? A photo of the rating/nameplate is perfect if you have one.", "chips": [{"value": "unknown", "label": "I don't know"}], "state": "INTAKE", "decision": null}, {"role": "user", "content": "The model plate is so worn, I can't read it anymore. It's an IVT though."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand your house is getting cold, and that's definitely something we need to address. Unfortunately, since we can't confirm the exact model of your IVT heat pump, especially given it's an older unit from the 90s, I can't give you specific troubleshooting steps from our manuals. Many issues can cause a heat pump to stop heating properly, and without knowing the specific model, I can't safely guide you to check anything that might resolve it. The best course of action here is to have a Nordland technician come out to properly diagnose the problem. They'll be able to identify your unit and safely determine why it's not heating.\n\nBefore I pass this to a Nordland VVS technician, please describe the problem in a bit more detail — and if the machine is showing any error or fault code, send a photo of the display (it really helps the technician). If there's no code, just let me know.", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "There's no error code on the display. It just doesn't seem to be pushing out warm air like it used to."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd like to get a Nordland VVS technician to help with this. Can I take a few details so they can follow up — what's your name?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Bengt Svensson"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "What's the best phone number to reach you?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "070-123 45 67"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "And your email? (type 'skip' if you'd rather not share it.)", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "bengt.svensson.74@email.com"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Finally, what's your postal code or address so we can route a technician?", "chips": [], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "111 52 Stockholm"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I have everything I need. Shall I send this to Nordland VVS so a technician can follow up?", "chips": [{"value": "yes_send", "label": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"value": "not_yet", "label": "Not yet"}], "state": "ESCALATE", "decision": "escalate"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Yes, send to Nordland"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Welcome back — good to hear from you again; I can see we've helped you before. Thanks Bengt Svensson! I've passed your details to Nordland VVS — they'll be in touch on +46701234567 as soon as they can. Is there anything else I can help with?", "chips": [], "state": "RESOLVED", "decision": "escalate"}], "latencies_sec": [6.314558744430542, 0.6294944286346436, 20.62575364112854, 0.07448053359985352, 0.02945685386657715, 0.1284925937652588, 0.05237627029418945, 0.10523605346679688, 1.9168143272399902], "avg_latency_sec": 3.3196292718251548, "wallclock_sec": 1949.8568506240845, "error": null}
